# SmartServe Mobile Application — Flutter Implementation Plan

This document outlines the architectural blueprint, phase-by-phase implementation plan, and time estimates for developing the **SmartServe Mobile Application** using Flutter.

---

## 🎯 Goal & Key Requirements

1. **Target Audience & Core Scope**:
   - **Staff & Admin**: Native mobile equipment scanning (QR Code / Barcode) using smartphone camera for fast inventory check-in, check-out, condition inspection, and dispatch status updates.
   - **Customers**: Mobile adaptation of `index.html` (Landing/Catalog/Booking) and `customer.html` (Customer Dashboard, Live Meeting Room, Booking Tracking, Notifications).
2. **Backend Integration**:
   - Connects directly to existing **Firebase (Auth & Firestore)** and **Supabase (PostgreSQL & Realtime)** databases.
   - Real-time two-way synchronization between website (`admin.html` / `customer.html`) and mobile app.

