## 📋 Open Questions / Options for Review

> [!NOTE]
> 1. **Scanner Hardware**: Will equipment assets use QR codes, Barcodes (Code 128 / EAN), or RFID tags? (The Flutter scanner supports both QR and standard 1D Barcodes).
> 2. **Offline Mode**: Do staff work in venues without cellular data where offline batch scanning and delayed sync is critical?
> 3. **App Stores**: Will this app be deployed to Google Play Store / Apple App Store, or distributed internally via APK / TestFlight?

